# Exception: this project's release key is committed on purpose so the
# GitHub Actions pipeline (no secrets access from this token) can sign
# release builds. It is a personal, direct-install app (no Play Store);
# rotate by regenerating the key + key.properties together (one-time
# reinstall on devices).
!android/key.properties
!android/app/keystore/

